From: Samuel Braun <sam@webry.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 15:30:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(app): a refusal that says git moved on leaves MovedOn

on_worker sets MovedOn for StopMovedOn from the worker, so the
window's one list opens git's stop instead of answering MovedOn again
and ending the stop twice.

Refs #1440
